// Shadow stub for a file the public riscvISACOV sample does not ship.
// RISCV_coverage_base.svh:41 includes "coverage/RISCV_coverage_vectors.svh"
// UNCONDITIONALLY, but no such file exists in the Apache-2.0 GitHub sample
// (verified across branches X-2025.12, X-2025.06, 20240904.0 and main).
// It belongs to the RVV (vector) support, which we neither have source for nor
// need: Vortex implements no RVV extension.
// Resolved via a shadow include directory placed AHEAD of third_party on the
// +incdir+ path, so third_party/riscvISACOV stays byte-for-byte unmodified.
